      "type": "tldr",
      "visible": true,
      "title": "TL;DR",
      "content": {
        "text": "**GAM** makes a pretrained Geometric Foundation Model the shared substrate for action decoding and future geometry prediction. The headline story is speed plus CAMERA robustness: **6.9 ms inference** and 83.1% success under LIBERO-Plus camera perturbations.~#212529:~",
        "blockHeight": 131,
        "blockAlign": "center",
